type: dataset
title: "USDA PLANTS characteristics for 534 plants, one row per plant"
abstract: "One row per plant for the 534 plants that Plant Data Sheets has a data sheet for: names, native status, the conservation plant characteristics PLANTS records (83 fields) and counts of the states and counties where PLANTS records the plant."
